3d6-c43a-4c85-b10d-0b1965acef2b","text":true,"v":" sit in the middle. The denture clips onto implants, which stops the movement and puts load back into the bone, while keeping the prosthesis removable."},{"_id":"059d4295-fc6d-4e57-9abd-9e834a90340e","type":"Paragraph","tag":"p","classes":["6a662886-a195-469b-a896-0bb1ebe17bd4"],"children":["f71e69f1-fad2-460a-8548-83031d99de37","6f280c93-4d19-4b62-936d-de2a4c2d64f3"],"data":{"devlink":{"runtimeProps":{},"slot":""},"displayName":"","attr":{"id":""},"xattr":[],"search":{"exclude":false},"visibility":{"conditions":[],"keepInHtml":{"tag":"False","val":{}}}}},{"_id":"f71e69f1-fad2-460a-8548-83031d99de37","type":"Block","tag":"strong","classes":["a884334f-6792-45eb-aa61-316bf95057da"],"children":["d6758859-4f70-428c-b472-b6662add5170"],"data":{"devlink":{"runtimeProps":{},"slot":""},"displayName":"","attr":{"id":""},"xattr":[],"search":{"exclude":false},"visibility":{"conditions":[],"keepInHtml":{"tag":"False","val":{}}},"text":true,"tag":"strong"}},{"_id":"d6758859-4f70-428c-b472-b6662add5170","text":true,"v":"Full-arch implants"},{"_id":"6f280c93-4d19-4b62-936d-de2a4c2d64f3","text":true,"v":" are the highest number up front and the lowest maintenance afterwards — a fixed bridge on four or more implants, with no relining, no adhesive and no nightly removal. Over a lifetime, that difference compounds."},{"_id":"78a6d137-6aaf-4e3a-a711-ca3755dc269c","type":"Paragraph","tag":"p","classes":["6a662886-a195-469b-a896-0bb1ebe17bd4"],"children":["44a89d70-0f03-46f9-85e4-f60b73b10421"],"data":{"devlink":{"runtimeProps":{},"slot":""},"displayName":"","attr":{"id":""},"xattr":[],"search":{"exclude":false},"visibility":{"conditions":[],"keepInHtml":{"tag":"False","val":{}}}}},{"_id":"44a89d70-0f03-46f9-85e4-f60b73b10421","text":true,"v":"An implant case is best read as an investment with a maintenance curve, not a purchase. Ask any practice quoting you what the ten-year cost looks like, not just the day-one one."},{"_id":"805ea5a0-c